                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. 绿宝石矿石" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="红宝石矿石被绿宝石矿石取代是因为开发人员Dinnerbone是一个红绿色盲，很难分清红宝石矿石和红石矿石的区别。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 溺尸" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="溺尸的呻吟声是音效师Samuel Åberg用牛奶漱喉的声音。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 陶瓦" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
